# Internal research + planning docs. Deliberately NOT part of the open-source
# release:
#   * the taxonomy (skills.json, locations.json) is derived from competitor
#     marketplaces and encodes the SEO strategy - it is maintained outside this
#     repo and will move to a private one.
#   * place-research holds ~82 MB of Census downloads.
# src/data/services.ts and the sitemap generator are GENERATED from the taxonomy,
# so regenerating them needs the private source. See README.
/docs/
/archive/
.wrangler

# Supabase CLI scratch (project ref, versions, pooler URL)
/supabase/.temp/

# Generated programmatic SEO sitemaps (built at deploy, not committed)
/public/sitemaps/
/public/sitemap.xml
